        "content": "$360^\\circ$",
        "rationale": "$360^\\circ$ is the period of sine and cosine."
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "content": "It does not repeat",
        "rationale": "$\\tan(x + 180^\\circ) = \\tan x$, so it repeats."
      },
      {
